  "title": "Muhammad Ali of Egypt",
  "summary": "Muhammad Ali Pasha took rule of Egypt on 17 May 1805 with the backing of the religious scholars. He destroyed the Mamluks in the Citadel Massacre of 1811 and later sent armies to the Hejaz, Nubia, Crete and the Levant. His reign ended with illness in 1848, and he died in 1849.",
